## Published

| # | Date | Piece | Format | Reach metric | Engagement metric | Conversion metric | Note |
|---|------|-------|--------|--------------|-------------------|-------------------|------|

Pick the three metric columns from the table below and write the chosen metric name into the header. Do not track all of them.

| Platform | Reach metric | Engagement metric | **Conversion metric (the one that matters)** |
|----------|--------------|-------------------|---------------------------------------------|
| Substack | Opens / open rate | Comments, restacks | **New subscribers attributable to the piece; paid conversions** |
| Threads | Non-follower reach % | Replies in first hour; reply depth | **Profile clicks, follows** |
| YouTube | Impressions, CTR | AVD / retention % | **Subscribers gained, lead-magnet clicks** |
| LinkedIn | Impressions | Comments, saves | **Profile views, conversations started** |
| Reddit | Upvotes | Comment threads engaged | **Profile views, DMs received** |
| Instagram | Reach | Saves, shares | **Profile visits, link taps** |
| Facebook | Reach | Comments (Groups) | **Conversations started** |
| X | Impressions | Replies, bookmarks | **Profile clicks, follows** |

