## Review log

| Date | Pieces since last review | Conversations produced | Decision |
|------|--------------------------|------------------------|----------|

Review this file whenever `@biz-review` runs. The decision column should be one of: continue, change approach, reduce cadence, or stop the channel. "Keep going" without evidence after a full review cycle is how a channel consumes a year.
